    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2695" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰσυμν-άω</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰσιμνάω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rule over</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰσυμνᾷ χθονός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Med.</u>
					19
				</span></i>
			; <i>preside over</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μολπῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					57.1
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Miletus</span>); generally, <i>rule</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ δίκαια αἰ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Iamb.</u>
					1.162
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>hold office of</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰσυμνήτης</span> (q. v.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>GDI</u>
				3053
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Chalcedon</span>), <i><span class="en">
				5632
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Teos</span>); at Naxos, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(9).223
			</span></i> (Eretria, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>).</div>
